{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"project":1},{"slug":2,"title":3,"date":4,"location":5,"description":6,"type":7,"developer":5,"publisher":5,"release":8,"featured":9,"content":10,"resources":11,"thumbnailMetadata":229},"other-mk","Other Mighty Kingdom Projects","2024","Mighty Kingdom","Other projects I worked on at Mighty Kingdom.","Spin Master","2021",true,"\u003Cp>A non-exhaustive list I&#39;ll be adding to over time of other projects that I was involved with at Mighty Kingdom.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2>Conan Chop Chop\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cdiv style=\"background-image: url('/microfolio/content/projects/other-mk/images/conan-chop-chop.jpg'); height: 250px; background-size: cover;\">\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp>Conan Chop Chop is a party roguelite for 1-4 players full of mayhem, loot, and adventure. In this outrageous take on Conan the Barbarian, you are the muscle-bound hero foolish enough to try and stop the evil wizard Thoth-Amon! \u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Released on Steam, PS4, Xbox One, and Switch in 2022. \u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>I was brought in occasionally to consult on design feedback, progression, and the onboarding experience.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Steam: \u003Ca href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1061880/Conan_Chop_Chop/\">https://store.steampowered.com/app/1061880/Conan_Chop_Chop/\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2>Serenity&#39;s Spa\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cdiv style=\"background-image: url('/microfolio/content/projects/other-mk/images/spa-image.png'); height: 300px; background-size: cover;\">\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>A tycoon-management game for mobile, where players run a beauty salon, and serve customers.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Originally commisioned by Lion Studios and developed by Mighty Kingdom, it was released in 2024 with over 1m+ downloads.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>I served as the \u003Cstrong>Release Manager\u003C/strong> on the project, including working with the SDK and Ad vendors to ensure a smooth launch.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Google Play: \u003Ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=co.gxgames.spa&hl=en_AU\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=co.gxgames.spa&amp;hl=en_AU\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n",{"images":12,"videos":227,"documents":228},[13,106,143,206],{"name":14,"path":15,"hasWebP":9,"metadata":16},"arcade.png","/microfolio/content/projects/other-mk/images/arcade.png",{"credit":17,"source":17,"description":17,"headline":17,"keywords":17,"camera":17,"lens":17,"focalLength":17,"aperture":17,"shutterSpeed":17,"iso":17,"dateTime":17,"gps":17,"city":17,"state":17,"country":17,"location":17,"raw":18,"creditLine":17},null,{"xmp":19,"png":76,"pngFile":101,"file":102},{"_raw":20,"about":21,"CreateDate":24,"ModifyDate":27,"MetadataDate":30,"DateCreated":32,"ColorMode":34,"ICCProfile":37,"PixelXDimension":40,"PixelYDimension":43,"ColorSpace":45,"ImageWidth":49,"ImageLength":51,"ResolutionUnit":53,"XResolution":57,"YResolution":61,"History":63},"\u003C?xpacket begin=\"ï»¿\" id=\"W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d\"?>\n\u003Cx:xmpmeta xmlns:x=\"adobe:ns:meta/\" x:xmptk=\"XMP Core 5.5.0\">\n \u003Crdf:RDF xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\">\n  \u003Crdf:Description rdf:about=\"\"\n    xmlns:xmp=\"http://ns.adobe.com/xap/1.0/\"\n    xmlns:photoshop=\"http://ns.adobe.com/photoshop/1.0/\"\n    xmlns:exif=\"http://ns.adobe.com/exif/1.0/\"\n    xmlns:tiff=\"http://ns.adobe.com/tiff/1.0/\"\n    xmlns:xmpMM=\"http://ns.adobe.com/xap/1.0/mm/\"\n    xmlns:stEvt=\"http://ns.adobe.com/xap/1.0/sType/ResourceEvent#\"\n   xmp:CreateDate=\"2023-12-19T14:18:54+1030\"\n   xmp:ModifyDate=\"2023-12-19T14:21:35+10:30\"\n   xmp:MetadataDate=\"2023-12-19T14:21:35+10:30\"\n   photoshop:DateCreated=\"2023-12-19T14:18:54+1030\"\n   photoshop:ColorMode=\"3\"\n   photoshop:ICCProfile=\"sRGB IEC61966-2.1\"\n   exif:PixelXDimension=\"512\"\n   exif:PixelYDimension=\"512\"\n   exif:ColorSpace=\"1\"\n   tiff:ImageWidth=\"512\"\n   tiff:ImageLengt